            <div>
                <head>Comments</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0015-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-5a.531" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-22T17:29:54.574+09:00">can all be discerned through their complexion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_007-2a.757" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-28T06:02:39.723+09:00">saying that Jīngzhōu is in urgent need</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_007-2a.1394" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-29T00:20:47.816+09:00">Wèi shī zhī lái, When the Wei armies arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_008-1a.807" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-01T00:22:48.624+09:00">Moreover treating others a subjects, and being treated by others as a (mere) subject</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_008-1a.890" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-01T00:28:47.035+09:00">train Hu Hai in study the law</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_008-1a.2521" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-02T00:02:57.47+09:00">the people participate and are capable."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_009-1a.273" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-04T00:40:34.357+09:00">the king's mind was on music and entertainment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-06T01:31:15.533+09:00">"The ruler is one who excels at employing officials;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-06T01:29:16.306+09:00">then the Son of Heaven can hold his hands and rectify the world."</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
